```java
@Component
@RequiredArgsConstructor
public class LoginAttemptListener {
    private static final int MAX = 5;
    private final MemberRepository repository;

    @EventListener
    @Transactional
    public void onFailure(AbstractAuthenticationFailureEvent event) {
        String email = event.getAuthentication().getName();
        repository.findByEmail(email).ifPresent(member -> {
            member.increaseFailedCount();
            if (member.getFailedCount() >= MAX) {
                member.lock();
            }
        });
    }

    @EventListener
    @Transactional
    public void onSuccess(InteractiveAuthenticationSuccessEvent event) {
        repository.findByEmail(event.getAuthentication().getName())
                .ifPresent(Member::resetFailedCount);
    }
}
```

> **`ifPresent` 라 없는 계정은 조용히** 지나간다.
> **4.4절의 감추기와 방향이** 같다.

**성공 이벤트를 `Interactive` 로 고른** 이유

> **9.1절**이다.
> **`AuthenticationSuccessEvent` 를 쓰면 API 호출마다 `update`** 가 나간다.

